          "snippet": {
            "line": 1832,
            "text": "theorem zeroMean_theta (c : Context D) (u : State D) (hm : u.mean = ⟨0, 0, 0⟩) :\n    u.thetaResidual c = c.operators.radialDiv 2 (u.covariance 0 1) +\n      c.operators.dz (u.covariance 2 1) - c.operators.radialDiv 2 c.virtualTheta"
